target: mf metarecord add
summary: Create a metarecord with the given fields and print its UUID (no selector)

!! Reference

```
Create a metarecord with the given fields and print its UUID (no selector)

Usage: mf metarecord add [OPTIONS] <SPECS>...

Arguments:
  <SPECS>...
          Field spec name:type[=value]; repeatable

Options:
  -f, --force
          Required to write mfr_* fields

  -h, --help
          Print help
```
